TASK 2: PALINDROME STRING

Aim:
To check whether a string is palindrome or not.

Theory:
A palindrome string reads the same from left to right and right to left.

Result:
The palindrome string was identified successfully.

--------------------------------------------------

TASK 3: VOWEL COUNT

Aim:
To count the number of vowels in a string.

Theory:
The characters of a string are checked individually to determine whether they are vowels.

Result:
The vowels in the string were counted successfully.